    "detailed_description": "<h1>Time to Serve...</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/cee1a6caabfe0391bb28df6b0a0dc836.poster.avif?t=1750812628\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/cee1a6caabfe0391bb28df6b0a0dc836.webm?t=1750812628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/cee1a6caabfe0391bb28df6b0a0dc836.mp4?t=1750812628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/01b50c7c7bc335353032255f462e7695.webp?t=1750812628\" width=625 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F</strong>irst-person psychological horror game. Serve as a cell servant in a dark underground prison holding dangerous prisoners, and explore a mysterious facility with a unique mix of realism and subtle surrealism.  <br> <br>This is a <strong>30-45 minutes horror</strong> experience  with the story gradually revealed through gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/cdcda0fb08e9fa2dcf83c75d48b7261a.poster.avif?t=1750812628\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/cdcda0fb08e9fa2dcf83c75d48b7261a.webm?t=1750812628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/cdcda0fb08e9fa2dcf83c75d48b7261a.mp4?t=1750812628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/469f3bf580ec538c0b26a580eaef2eea.webp?t=1750812628\" width=625 height=63 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>T</strong>his game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator with prison serving routine simulation and conversation mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/03c2f9718adf1b2ce1531e725ebcf347.poster.avif?t=1750812628\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/03c2f9718adf1b2ce1531e725ebcf347.webm?t=1750812628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/03c2f9718adf1b2ce1531e725ebcf347.mp4?t=1750812628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/cc406d395a62811c7cf96947f2900065.webp?t=1750812628\" width=625 height=63 /></span>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric prison environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized yet Realistic aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing as a Cell Servant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beloved Horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/dd2ce0f11f6fe29c9721c5898765e607.poster.avif?t=1750812628\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/dd2ce0f11f6fe29c9721c5898765e607.webm?t=1750812628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686460/extras/dd2ce0f11f6fe29c9721c5898765e607.mp4?t=1750812628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
